            {
                "entry_id": "ab637c40-5220-3236-9a74-344405548d6a",
                "word": "politic",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "83fa5170-9767-4246-8b5e-3e7582671269",
                        "entry_id": "ab637c40-5220-3236-9a74-344405548d6a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "politics"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a76f4d58-5ad9-3583-a9f4-9a22fd1e0af2",
                        "entry_id": "ab637c40-5220-3236-9a74-344405548d6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A politician."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c77652a-237b-4d97-8fd3-87113bb6be5c",
                                "sense_id": "a76f4d58-5ad9-3583-a9f4-9a22fd1e0af2",
                                "text": "to speake truly of politikes & Statesmen"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "637206ce-fbe4-4e7e-94c8-87f649adaa4d",
                                "sense_id": "a76f4d58-5ad9-3583-a9f4-9a22fd1e0af2",
                                "text": "Swiftly the politic goes; is it dark? he borrows a lantern; / Slowly the statesman and sure, guiding his feet by the stars."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33f076a3-5dc3-4cc0-9733-004aa9157771",
                                "sense_id": "a76f4d58-5ad9-3583-a9f4-9a22fd1e0af2",
                                "text": "And therefore our politic Asclepius may be supposed to have exhibited the power of his art only to persons who... had a definite ailment."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fdd7a61e-40c6-3fba-a717-61ed6225aff3",
                        "entry_id": "ab637c40-5220-3236-9a74-344405548d6a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A politics; a set of political beliefs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a530217-8c69-4ae4-b61b-0c1b542183a9",
                                "sense_id": "fdd7a61e-40c6-3fba-a717-61ed6225aff3",
                                "text": "While the stories and lives on the screen are alternately moving and funny, an unspoken question arises: does similar experience always lead to a coherent politic?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
